# Data outputs (regenerable) — match at any depth so examples/*/data/* is also ignored
# Trailing-glob forms catch suffixed variants like data/cases_ladder_pillar_ablation/
# and archived failure dumps like data/cases_..._bcfail_<ts>/.
**/data/stl/
**/data/cases/
**/data/cases_*/
**/data/results/
**/data/results_*/
**/data/experiments/
**/data/manual_verification/
**/data/manual_verification_complex/
**/data/premise_test/

# Stale paper-source archive (superseded by bayesian_src/; kept locally as backup)
/bayesian.zip

# Saved simulation run snapshots (e.g. data_run1, data_run_old)
**/data_run*/

# OpenFOAM runtime artifacts
**/processor*/
**/postProcessing/
**/logs/

# Logs
*.log
nohup.out

